<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
<div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">For independent climbing gyms</p>
<h1 id="hero-title">Make room<br>for the <span class="climb">climb.<svg viewBox="0 0 220 15" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10Q105-3 216 7M12 14Q115 3 201 10"/></svg></span></h1>
<p class="hero-description">Memberships, class bookings, and day passes, all in one calm place. Meet Tidepool, a helping hand behind your front desk.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><button class="button" data-open-demo>Explore the demo <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><a class="text-link" href="#toolkit">See how it works <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v13m-5-5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></a></div>
<p class="hero-footnote"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m2 16 5-11 4 7 3-5 4 9H2Z"/></svg>Built around the everyday rhythm of your gym.</p>
</div>
<div class="hero-art">
<img class="photo" src="__HERO_IMAGE__" alt="A climber finding their next hold above a turquoise sea" width="1000" height="722" fetchpriority="high">
<span class="photo-label" aria-hidden="true">Find your flow.</span>
<div class="sample-window" role="img" aria-label="Sample Tidepool overview: 248 active members, 6 classes today, and 32 day passes. Member Jamie Ellis is checked in.">
<div class="window-bar"><span class="mini-brand"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#logo"/></svg>tidepool</span><span class="sample-label">Boulder House · Sample gym</span></div>
<div class="sample-body"><div class="sample-title"><strong>A good day in the making.</strong><span>Your gym at a glance</span></div><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>Active members</span><strong>248</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Classes today</span><strong>6</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Day passes</span><strong>32</strong></div></div><div class="checkin-row"><span class="avatar">JE</span><div class="name"><strong>Jamie Ellis</strong><span>Monthly membership</span></div><span class="check-status"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#check"/></svg>Checked in</span></div></div>
</div><span class="under-art">A little breathing room for your gym</span>
</div>
</section>
