<div class="section-intro"><h2 id="toolkit-title">Your whole front desk.<br>A little more together.</h2><p>From your regulars to the first-timers.<br>Keep the details in hand, and your attention on the people.</p></div>
<div class="toolkit-grid">
<div class="feature-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Explore the toolkit" aria-orientation="vertical">
<button class="feature-tab" id="tab-memberships" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="toolkit-panel" data-feature="memberships"><span class="feature-number">01</span><span><strong>Memberships, with a human side.</strong><p>A familiar face, a membership status, the details you need. Keep your climbing community in view.</p></span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h12M10 4v12"/></svg></button>
<button class="feature-tab" id="tab-classes" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="toolkit-panel" tabindex="-1" data-feature="classes"><span class="feature-number">02</span><span><strong>A place in the next class.</strong><p>Bring class bookings into the same picture. See who'"'s coming and how many spots are left.</p></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M10 4v12\"/></svg></button>
<button class=\"feature-tab\" id=\"tab-passes\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"toolkit-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-feature=\"passes\"><span class=\"feature-number\">03</span><span><strong>Good climbs start at check-in.</strong><p>Give day passes a home alongside your memberships. Get the next climber from the desk to the wall.</p></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M10 4v12\"/></svg></button>
</div>
<div class=\"preview-stage\" id=\"toolkit-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-memberships\" tabindex=\"0\"><div id=\"inline-preview\"></div><p class=\"preview-note\">A small look inside Tidepool · Illustrative sample data</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class=\"community wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"community-title\">
<svg class=\"contour\" viewBox=\"0 0 550 550\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M300 5C470 0 550 150 520 300S450 560 280 540 0 430 20 260 130 10 300 5Z\"/><path d=\"M298 35C450 28 518 158 490 295S426 526 282 510 30 420 50 263 148 42 298 35Z\"/><path d=\"M296 65C430 55 486 166 460 290S402 492 284 480 60 410 80 266 166 74 296 65Z\"/><path d=\"M294 95C410 82 454 174 430 285S378 458 286 450 90 400 110 269 184 106 294 95Z\"/><path d=\"M292 125C390 109 422 182 400 280S354 424 288 420 120 390 140 272 202 138 292 125Z\"/><path d=\"M290 155C370 136 390 190 370 275S330 390 290 390 150 380 170 275 220 170 290 155Z\"/><path d=\"M288 185C350 163 358 198 340 270S306 356 292 360 180 370 200 278 238 202 288 185Z\"/></svg>
