<footer class=\"footer wrap\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#logo\"/></svg>tidepool</a><p>Memberships. Class bookings. Day passes. Room to climb.</p><a href=\"#top\">Back to the top <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span></a></footer>
